msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: World of Horror\n"
"Language: zh_Hans\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"

msgctxt "woh_addy:0"
msgid "You've retrieved an item from storage!"
msgstr "已取出库存物品！"

msgctxt "woh_addy:1"
msgid "Not enough room for an item!"
msgstr "空间不足以容纳物品！"

msgctxt "woh_addy:2"
msgid "STORAGE"
msgstr "库存"

msgctxt "woh_addy:3"
msgid "STORED ITEMS"
msgstr "已存放的物品"

msgctxt "woh_addy:4"
msgid "Not enough room! Item added to the storage!"
msgstr "空间不足！物品已置入库存中！"

msgctxt "woh_addy:5"
msgid "To gain a new level, press the flashing button."
msgstr "按下正在闪烁的按钮以升级。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:6"
msgid "You don't have enough experience!"
msgstr "经验不足！"

msgctxt "woh_addy:7"
msgid "TALK WITH STUDENT"
msgstr "与学生对话"

msgctxt "woh_addy:8"
msgid "SET UP A TELESCOPE"
msgstr "架设望远镜"

msgctxt "woh_addy:9"
msgid "RETURN"
msgstr "返回"

msgctxt "woh_addy:10"
msgid "You don't have a telescope."
msgstr "你没有望远镜。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:11"
msgid "Student is mumbling something to herself."
msgstr "学生自言自语着。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:12"
msgid "You should probably leave her alone."
msgstr "或许还是离她远点吧。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:13"
msgid "Cold water helps you to organize your thoughts. (+1 REASON)"
msgstr "冷水有助于整理思绪。（+1理智）"

msgctxt "woh_addy:14"
msgid "Hot water helps with your sore muscles. (+1 STAMINA)"
msgstr "热水有助于缓解肌肉酸痛。（+1体力）"

msgctxt "woh_addy:15"
msgid ""
"Nailing a straw doll to this tree will grant you your wish...\n"
"\n"
"for a price, that is."
msgstr ""
"在这棵树上钉一个稻草\n"
"人偶，便能如愿以偿……\n"
"\n"
"只不过，也会欠下一笔\n"
"待偿之债。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:16"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"[you can nail two more straw dolls here]"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"[你可以再钉上两个稻草人偶]"

msgctxt "woh_addy:17"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"[you can nail one more straw doll here]"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"[你可以再钉上一个稻草人偶]"

msgctxt "woh_addy:18"
msgid ""
"You shouldn't have come here again.\n"
"(+1% DOOM)"
msgstr ""
"你不应该再回来的。\n"
"（+1%灾厄）"

msgctxt "woh_addy:19"
msgid "WITCH'S TREE"
msgstr "巫树"

msgctxt "woh_addy:20"
msgid "According to legends, this tree's roots reach towards the grave of a lynched witch..."
msgstr ""
"传言，此树之根须，触及了一位死于私刑的女巫的\n"
"坟墓……"

msgctxt "woh_addy:21"
msgid "You notice a wallet hidden underneath a fallen branch. (+2 FUNDS)"
msgstr "你发现在折落的树枝下，遗落着一个钱包。（+2资金）"

msgctxt "woh_addy:22"
msgid "The buried witch takes her toll..."
msgstr "葬于此地的女巫，索取了她的债……"

msgctxt "woh_addy:23"
msgid "You head fills with forbidden chants!"
msgstr "禁忌的吟诵声在你脑海中萦绕不去！"

msgctxt "woh_addy:24"
msgid "You suddenly feel much better! (+2 STAMINA)"
msgstr "你忽然感觉浑身有力！（+2体力）"

msgctxt "woh_addy:25"
msgid ""
"wish for strength\n"
"[+2 STAMINA]"
msgstr ""
"许愿力量\n"
"[+2体力]"

msgctxt "woh_addy:26"
msgid ""
"wish for knowledge\n"
"[+SPELL]"
msgstr ""
"许愿知识\n"
"[+法术]"

msgctxt "woh_addy:27"
msgid ""
"wish for money\n"
"[+2 FUNDS]"
msgstr ""
"许愿金钱\n"
"[+2资金]"

msgctxt "woh_addy:28"
msgid ""
"it's a bad idea\n"
"[leave]"
msgstr ""
"不是什么好主意\n"
"[离开]"

msgctxt "woh_addy:29"
msgid ""
"You are stopped by a young policewoman.\n"
"\n"
"<<How can we help you?>>"
msgstr ""
"一个年轻的女警察拦住了你。\n"
"\n"
"<<我们能帮上什么忙吗？>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:30"
msgid "POLICE STATION"
msgstr "警察局"

msgctxt "woh_addy:31"
msgid "Officers at the police station are busy working on various weird cases..."
msgstr ""
"警察局里的警官们，\n"
"正因各种各样的诡谲案件\n"
"而焦头烂额……"

msgctxt "woh_addy:32"
msgid "request more police patrols"
msgstr "要求警方加强巡逻"

msgctxt "woh_addy:33"
msgid "complain about police patrols"
msgstr "抱怨警方的巡逻"

msgctxt "woh_addy:34"
msgid ""
"share some information\n"
"(11 EXP -> 1 FND)"
msgstr ""
"分享情报\n"
"（11经验->1资金）"

msgctxt "woh_addy:35"
msgid "exit the station"
msgstr "离开警察局"

msgctxt "woh_addy:36"
msgid ""
"Officer thanks you and promises more police patrols.\n"
"[Threat Level decreased]"
msgstr ""
"警官向你表达了感谢，并承诺了加强巡逻。\n"
"[威胁等级降低]"

msgctxt "woh_addy:37"
msgid "The officer apologizes and says they don't have any patrol units left."
msgstr "警官向你表达了歉意，告知你已没有多余警力可供巡逻了。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:38"
msgid ""
"The detective thanks you for the information and hands you a reward.\n"
"[-11 EXP / +1 FUNDS]"
msgstr ""
"警探向你提供的信息表达了感谢，并给了你一份奖励。\n"
"[-11经验/+1资金]"

msgctxt "woh_addy:39"
msgid "The detective thanks you for the information but says that's not enough for a prize."
msgstr "警探向你提供的信息表达了感谢，但告诉你这还不足以赢取奖励。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:40"
msgid ""
"You've finally made it inside the cursed lighthouse!\n"
"\n"
"Your gut is telling you two things: that whoever (or whatever) is behind the weird events, must be on the highest floor of this place and that you should run away from this place as far and fast as you can. You're afraid there won't be a way back once you start climbing these stairs..."
msgstr ""
"你终于进入了诅咒灯塔之内！\n"
"\n"
"直觉告诉了你两件事：其一，不论这些怪异事件的幕后黑手是谁（或什么东西），祂都一定在这个地方的最顶层。其二，你应该逃离这个地方，越远越好，越快越好。你心中惧怕：一旦踏上这些楼梯，就再无路可退了……"

msgctxt "woh_addy:41"
msgid "access storage"
msgstr "打开库存"

msgctxt "woh_addy:42"
msgid "rest a bit (+2% DOOM)"
msgstr "稍加休息（+2%灾厄）"

msgctxt "woh_addy:43"
msgid "start climbing"
msgstr "爬上楼梯"

msgctxt "woh_addy:44"
msgid "You've rested a bit. (+1 REASON and STAMINA)"
msgstr "你稍微休息了一会儿。（+1理智，+1体力）"

msgctxt "woh_addy:45"
msgid "LIGHTHOUSE (GROUND FLOOR)"
msgstr "灯塔（底层）"

msgctxt "woh_addy:46"
msgid "As the unnatural fog slowly lifts you are relieved and collapse on the floor..."
msgstr "超乎自然的雾气缓缓散去时，你长舒口气，颓然倒地……"

msgctxt "woh_addy:47"
msgid ""
"The dark clouds swirl around the lighthouse.\n"
"Did you arrive too late?"
msgstr ""
"黑云萦绕在灯塔之上。\n"
"你来得太晚了么？"

msgctxt "woh_addy:48"
msgid "THE MONUMENT"
msgstr "遗碑"

msgctxt "woh_addy:49"
msgid "Forgotten by everyone, the OUTER ENTITY waits patiently for those, who need it..."
msgstr "为众生所遗忘的外神，静候着有求于祂之人……"

msgctxt "woh_addy:50"
msgid ""
"leave without a sacrifice \n"
"[angers the OUTER ENTITY]"
msgstr ""
"不作献祭，转身离开\n"
"[激怒外神]"

msgctxt "woh_addy:51"
msgid "You cut your hand and fill the bowl with your blood..."
msgstr "你割破手掌，将鲜血滴入碗中……"

msgctxt "woh_addy:52"
msgid "You can feel your most cherised memories leave you..."
msgstr "你感觉到那些最珍贵的记忆离你远去……"

msgctxt "woh_addy:53"
msgid "You burn the money in the bowl..."
msgstr "你将钱放入碗中，焚烧起来……"

msgctxt "woh_addy:54"
msgid "You've angered the OUTER ENTITY..."
msgstr "你激怒了外神……"

msgctxt "woh_addy:55"
msgid "Bargaining with an OUTER ENTITY is a risky thing but maybe it can postpone the approaching doom?"
msgstr "与外神交涉自然是兵行险着，但或许祂能够推迟那迫在眉睫的末日？"

msgctxt "woh_addy:56"
msgid "feed the OUTER ENTITY with your blood"
msgstr "将你的鲜血献给外神"

msgctxt "woh_addy:57"
msgid "give the OUTER ENTITY your most cherished memories"
msgstr "将你最珍贵的记忆献给外神"

msgctxt "woh_addy:58"
msgid "leave a material gift"
msgstr "献上实质的礼物"

msgctxt "woh_addy:59"
msgid "You still have some time before you are asked to the office."
msgstr "在轮到你进办公室前，你还有些许时间。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:60"
msgid "RECEPTION AREA"
msgstr "接待区"

msgctxt "woh_addy:61"
msgid "You wait patiently in the reception area."
msgstr "你在接待区耐心地等候着。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:62"
msgid "Many sick people are waiting to be examined by the overworked hospital staff."
msgstr "许多病人在等待疲于奔波的医院工作人员为他们做检查。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:63"
msgid "enter DOCTOR'S OFFICE (+2% DOOM)"
msgstr "进入诊室（+2%灾厄）"

msgctxt "woh_addy:64"
msgid "move to CORRIDOR A"
msgstr "前往走廊A"

msgctxt "woh_addy:65"
msgid ""
"enter PHARMACY\n"
"(+3% DOOM)"
msgstr ""
"进入药房\n"
"（+3%灾厄）"

msgctxt "woh_addy:66"
msgid "A nurse walks past you in a hurry."
msgstr ""
"一名护士从你身旁\n"
"匆匆走过。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:67"
msgid "DOCTOR'S OFFICE"
msgstr "诊室"

msgctxt "woh_addy:68"
msgid "The emergency department is crowded as a direct result of the weird things happening in your town."
msgstr ""
"城里发生的诸多怪异事件，\n"
"让急诊科拥挤不堪。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:69"
msgid ""
"You finally are asked to the doctor's office.\n"
"\n"
"<<Now... how can I help you today?>>"
msgstr ""
"终于轮到你进入诊室了。\n"
"\n"
"<<那么……我今天能为您做些什么呢？>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:70"
msgid "EXIT"
msgstr "离开"

msgctxt "woh_addy:71"
msgid "[ADDITIONAL ACTIONS AVAILABLE ON THE INJURY CARDS]"
msgstr "[伤势卡牌可用的额外行动]"

msgctxt "woh_addy:72"
msgid "You use the opportunity and steal a bottle of pills."
msgstr "你趁机偷走了一瓶药片。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:73"
msgid "You shouldn't risk stealing another bottle."
msgstr "没必要冒险再偷一瓶。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:74"
msgid "You feel like the skull is observing your every move."
msgstr "你感觉那头骨正注视着你的一举一动。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:75"
msgid "CORRIDOR A"
msgstr "走廊A"

msgctxt "woh_addy:76"
msgid "You venture further down the corridor..."
msgstr ""
"你沿着走廊继续\n"
"摸索下去……"

msgctxt "woh_addy:77"
msgid "return to the RECEPTION AREA"
msgstr "返回接待区"

msgctxt "woh_addy:78"
msgid "take the ELEVATOR"
msgstr "乘坐电梯"

msgctxt "woh_addy:79"
msgid "enter MORGUE"
msgstr "进入太平间"

msgctxt "woh_addy:80"
msgid "What are you doing here?"
msgstr "你来这里做什么？"

msgctxt "woh_addy:81"
msgid "The morgue's door is closed."
msgstr "太平间的门紧闭着。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:82"
msgid "CORRIDOR B"
msgstr "走廊B"

msgctxt "woh_addy:83"
msgid "Upper floor is eerily silent in comparison..."
msgstr ""
"相比之下，楼上\n"
"异常地寂静……"

msgctxt "woh_addy:84"
msgid "check out PATIENT ROOM"
msgstr "查看病房"

msgctxt "woh_addy:85"
msgid "You shouldn't bother the recovering patients."
msgstr "还是不要打扰仍在恢复中的病人了。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:86"
msgid "RESTING AT HOME"
msgstr "在家休息"

msgctxt "woh_addy:87"
msgid "It certainly feels good to be back at home."
msgstr "回到家的感觉真好。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:88"
msgid "STAMINA/REASON"
msgstr "体力/理智"

msgctxt "woh_addy:89"
msgid "Time flies by so fast, you prepare yourself to leave and continue your long investigation."
msgstr ""
"时间转瞬即逝。你准备好离开，继续你的迢迢\n"
"调查路。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:90"
msgid "DOOM"
msgstr "灾厄"

msgctxt "woh_addy:91"
msgid "STAMINA/REASON"
msgstr "体力/理智"

msgctxt "woh_addy:92"
msgid ""
"Wait... what's that?\n"
"[SOMETHING EVIL KNOWS WHERE YOU LIVE]"
msgstr ""
"等等……那是什么？\n"
"[某些邪恶存在已经知悉你的住所]"

msgctxt "woh_addy:93"
msgid "You take a short nap on your bed."
msgstr "你在床上小憩片刻。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:94"
msgid "You bandage up the fresh wounds."
msgstr "你将新伤包扎起来。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:95"
msgid "You take a long hot shower."
msgstr "你洗了很久的热水澡。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:96"
msgid "You swallow the painkillers."
msgstr "你吃了止痛药。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:97"
msgid "You phone your best friend and talk about unrelated stuff."
msgstr "你和最好的朋友通了电话，聊了无关的事。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:98"
msgid "You sit on a couch and read your favorite book."
msgstr "你坐在沙发上，读了你最爱的书。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:99"
msgid "APARTMENT CORRIDOR"
msgstr "公寓走廊"

msgctxt "woh_addy:100"
msgid "You knock on your friend's door and wait..."
msgstr ""
"你敲响朋友的门，\n"
"等待着……"

msgctxt "woh_addy:101"
msgid "<<Hey dork, I'm with you. Why are we going back to my place?>>"
msgstr "<<喂，呆子，我这不是跟你在一起呢吗。还去我家干什么？>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:102"
msgid "<<Heyyy... I'm really busy today. Let's hang out some other time, okay?>>"
msgstr ""
"<<嘿……我今天实在是\n"
"有点忙。我们改天再出去\n"
"玩吧，好吗？>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:103"
msgid ""
"Huh, KANA's not home.\n"
"You should check later..."
msgstr ""
"佳那不在家。\n"
"之后再来看看吧……"

msgctxt "woh_addy:104"
msgid "Shopping for items takes precious time. (+4% DOOM)"
msgstr "购买物品也需要宝贵的时间。（+4%灾厄）"

msgctxt "woh_addy:105"
msgid "Huh... where is that dog?"
msgstr "嗯……那只狗呢？"

msgctxt "woh_addy:106"
msgid "SHOPPING FOR ITEMS"
msgstr "购买物品"

msgctxt "woh_addy:107"
msgid "EXIT WITHOUT BUYING ANYTHING"
msgstr "不购买物品便离开"

msgctxt "woh_addy:108"
msgid "needs YAKUZA CARD"
msgstr "需要黑道卡"

msgctxt "woh_addy:109"
msgid "AVAILABLE ITEMS"
msgstr "可用物品"

msgctxt "woh_addy:110"
msgid "PRICE"
msgstr "价格"

msgctxt "woh_addy:111"
msgid "FUNDS"
msgstr "资金"

msgctxt "woh_addy:112"
msgid "A random discounted item."
msgstr "一件随机打折物品。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:113"
msgid "RESTOCK"
msgstr "补货"

msgctxt "woh_addy:114"
msgid "reroll items (+3% DOOM)"
msgstr "重骰物品（+3%灾厄）"

msgctxt "woh_addy:115"
msgid "You've bought a new item."
msgstr "你购买了一件新物品。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:116"
msgid "You don't have enough money."
msgstr "你没有足够的钱。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:117"
msgid "Woof!-"
msgstr "汪！-"

msgctxt "woh_addy:118"
msgid "-DISCOUNT ITEM-"
msgstr "-打折物品-"

msgctxt "woh_addy:119"
msgid "On your way out, you stop by the vending machines. (+2% DOOM)"
msgstr "你离开前顺便去了一趟自动售货机。（+1%灾厄）"

msgctxt "woh_addy:120"
msgid "SHOP FOR ITEMS"
msgstr "购买物品"

msgctxt "woh_addy:121"
msgid ""
"[costs DOOM to enter]\n"
"[funds -> items]"
msgstr ""
"[增加灾厄以进入]\n"
"[资金->物品]"

msgctxt "woh_addy:122"
msgid ""
"[costs DOOM to enter]\n"
"[regain STAMINA and REASON]"
msgstr ""
"[增加灾厄以进入]\n"
"[恢复体力与理智]"

msgctxt "woh_addy:123"
msgid "REST"
msgstr "休息"

msgctxt "woh_addy:124"
msgid "VENDING MACHINE"
msgstr "自动售货机"

msgctxt "woh_addy:125"
msgid ""
"Entering the ILLEGAL DEN, you instantly recognize the girl who attacked you and dropped the prescription.\n"
"You throw the expensive medicine on the table before getting closer.\n"
"\n"
"<<I-is that the drug for my grandma?...>> Her eyes light up.\n"
"<<I thought it was gone forever... but why would you help me at all?>>"
msgstr ""
"进入非法窝点后，你立刻就认出了那个攻击过你，而且还掉了份处方的女孩。\n"
"你把昂贵的药物扔到桌上，然后走近她。\n"
"\n"
"<<那、那是我奶奶的药吗？……>>她的双眼一亮。\n"
"<<我还以为再也找不回来了……可你为什么要帮我？>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:126"
msgid "explain what's currently happening"
msgstr "解释当下的情况"

msgctxt "woh_addy:127"
msgid "<<If what you're saying is true, I'll help you!>>"
msgstr "<<如果你说的都是真的，我会帮你的！>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:128"
msgid "<<...name's MIKU, by the way.>>"
msgstr "<<……顺便一提，我叫未久。>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:129"
msgid "LEAVE"
msgstr "离开"

msgctxt "woh_addy:130"
msgid "WAIT (+2% DOOM)"
msgstr "等待（+2%灾厄）"

msgctxt "woh_addy:131"
msgid "LATEST GOSSIP"
msgstr "最新传言"

msgctxt "woh_addy:132"
msgid "ASK TO JOIN YOU"
msgstr "邀请其加入你"

msgctxt "woh_addy:133"
msgid "OBSERVE"
msgstr "观察"

msgctxt "woh_addy:134"
msgid "SHARE A CREEPY STORY [-5 EXP]"
msgstr "分享恐怖故事[+5经验]"

msgctxt "woh_addy:135"
msgid "FORCE TO HELP YOU"
msgstr "强迫其帮助你"

msgctxt "woh_addy:136"
msgid ""
"GOSSIP - Learn both random and case-related news.\n"
"ASK - Recruitment test based on CHARISMA (repeatable).\n"
"FORCE - Recruitment test based on equipment, STRENGTH and current DOOM"
msgstr ""
"传言 - 了解与案件相关的或随机的新闻。\n"
"邀请 - 基于魅力的招募检定（可重复）。\n"
"强迫 - 基于装备、力量及当前灾厄值的招募检定。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:137"
msgid "<<Sorry, I don't have time for games.>>"
msgstr "<<抱歉，我没空胡闹。>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:138"
msgid "<<Give me a break!>>"
msgstr "<<别烦我了！>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:139"
msgid "<<You were always sucha a kidder!>>"
msgstr "<<你可真爱开玩笑！>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:140"
msgid "<<I will help you!>>"
msgstr "<<我会帮你的！>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:141"
msgid "<<It sounds strange... but I believe you!>>"
msgstr "<<听起来不太对劲……但我相信你！>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:142"
msgid "<<Did you hear? There's a cliff nearby with strangely shaped holes...>>"
msgstr "<<你听说了吗？附近有处悬崖，上面有奇形怪状的洞……>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:143"
msgid "<<Have you heard about this computer program that...>>"
msgstr "<<你听说过这个电脑程序吗，它……>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:144"
msgid "<<She hasn't come to school since last week...>>"
msgstr "<<她从上周起就没来上学了……>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:145"
msgid "<<How did you do on your English exam?>>"
msgstr "<<你的英语考试考得怎么样？>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:146"
msgid "<<If OOO didn't make those drawings, then who did?>>"
msgstr "<<如果这些画不是OOO画的，那是谁画的？>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:147"
msgid "<<It's been so hard to get any sleep lately.>>"
msgstr "<<最近入睡很困难。>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:148"
msgid "<<I keep hearing a wailing sound coming from the 3rd stall in the girls' bathroom.>>"
msgstr "<<从女厕所的第三个隔间里一直传出来哭号声。>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:149"
msgid "<<...he hasn't been the same since he came back.>>"
msgstr "<<……自打回来之后，他就变得不一样了。>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:150"
msgid "<<Recently, the tap water in my entire neighborhood started tasting weird. Almost like...>>"
msgstr "<<最近，整个小区里的自来水喝起来都有怪味。感觉几乎像是……>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:151"
msgid "<<...yesterday, she told me she saw it again.>>"
msgstr "<<……昨天，她说她又看到那个东西了。>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:152"
msgid "notices you and smiles."
msgstr "看到了你，冲你笑笑。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:153"
msgid "waves at you."
msgstr "冲你招手。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:154"
msgid "<<Have you heard about this computer program that...>>"
msgstr "<<你听说过这个电脑程序吗，它……>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:155"
msgid "<<She hasn't come to school since last week...>>"
msgstr "<<她从上周起就没来上学了……>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:156"
msgid "<<How did you do on your English exam?>>"
msgstr "<<你的英语考试考得怎么样？>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:157"
msgid "<<If OOO didn't make those drawings, then who did?>>"
msgstr "<<如果这些画不是OOO画的，那是谁画的？>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:158"
msgid "<<It's been so hard to get any sleep lately.>>"
msgstr "<<最近入睡很困难。>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:159"
msgid "is taking their pen apart and putting it back together over and over."
msgstr "正在把自己的笔翻来覆去地拆开又装起来。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:160"
msgid "is waiting for the class to begin."
msgstr "正在等待上课。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:161"
msgid "is staring at the clouds. They look like heads."
msgstr "正在盯着云朵。看起来像头颅。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:162"
msgid "is reading a horror manga about spirals."
msgstr "正在阅读一本关于螺旋的恐怖漫画。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:163"
msgid "They seem relaxed."
msgstr "TA看起来很放松。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:164"
msgid "They look fine."
msgstr "TA看起来还好。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:165"
msgid "They look nervous."
msgstr "TA看起来很紧张。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:166"
msgid "There is something _off_about them."
msgstr "TA似乎有些_不对劲_。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:167"
msgid "They are trembling with fear."
msgstr "TA害怕得发抖。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:168"
msgid "You don't know any good stories to share."
msgstr "你没什么好故事可以分享。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:169"
msgid ""
"seems visibly shaken by your story.\n"
"<<I-it's just a story, right?...>>"
msgstr ""
"看起来明显被你的故事震撼到了。\n"
"<<这、这只是个故事而已，对吧？……>>"

msgctxt "woh_addy:170"
msgid "combined INTIMIDATION value"
msgstr "综合威吓值"

msgctxt "woh_addy:171"
msgid ""
"Student, threatened by your weapon, agrees to help you.\n"
"Don't expect them to stay loyal though."
msgstr ""
"出于对你所持武器的恐惧，学生同意了帮助你。\n"
"但不要指望TA能有多忠诚。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:172"
msgid ""
"Student shoves you away and escapes, screaming for help.\n"
"(+5% DOOM)"
msgstr ""
"学生猛地推开你逃走，尖叫着求救。\n"
"（+5%灾厄）"

msgctxt "woh_addy:173"
msgid "The burned down school building is empty."
msgstr "葬于大火的学校大楼空空荡荡。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:174"
msgid "Many of the books you can find here were donated after the accident at the university building."
msgstr "这里许多书都是在大学的建筑事故后，受捐赠而来的。"

msgctxt "woh_addy:175"
msgid "LIBRARY"
msgstr "图书馆"

msgctxt "woh_addy:176"
msgid "You feel the gaze of a librarian..."
msgstr "你能感受到图书管理员的注视……"

msgctxt "woh_addy:177"
msgid ""
"study old tomes\n"
"[+SPELL; +3% DOOM]"
msgstr ""
"研究古老典籍\n"
"[+法术；+3%灾厄]"

msgctxt "woh_addy:178"
msgid ""
"make notes\n"
"[+5 EXP; +2% DOOM]"
msgstr ""
"做笔记\n"
"[+5经验；+2%灾厄]"

msgctxt "woh_addy:179"
msgid "You carry out a few books to the main reading room..."
msgstr "你把几本书拿到了主阅览室……"

msgctxt "woh_addy:180"
msgid ""
"You decide to make some notes about subjects that could be relevant in this case.\n"
"\n"
"Hopefully all your work won't go to waste.\n"
"[+5 EXPERIENCE]"
msgstr ""
"你决定就与此案相关的内容做些记录。\n"
"\n"
"希望这一切不会是徒劳无功。\n"
"[+5经验]"

msgctxt "woh_addy:181"
msgid "You carry out a dusty tome to the main reading room..."
msgstr "你把一本积满灰尘的古籍拿到了主阅览室……"

msgctxt "woh_addy:182"
msgid "return the book and go back"
msgstr "归还书籍并返回"

msgctxt "woh_addy:183"
msgid "return the books and exit the library"
msgstr "归还书籍并离开图书馆"

msgctxt "woh_addy:184"
msgid ""
"Interpreting the old, incomplete translations is a tedious task.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, you find the fragment you were looking for.\n"
"[+NEW SPELL]"
msgstr ""
"解读古老且残缺不全的译本既繁琐又乏味。\n"
"\n"
"最终，你找到了一直在寻找的片段。\n"
"[+新法术]"

msgctxt "woh_addy:185"
msgid "[NEW ACHIEVEMENT UNLOCKED!]"
msgstr "[新成就解锁！]"

msgctxt "woh_addy:186"
msgid "The nurse treats"
msgstr "护士治疗"

msgctxt "woh_addy:187"
msgid ""
"<<Sorrrry dearr, a patient is herre. I'll call you back...>>\n"
"says the nurse as she's eyeing you up.\n"
"\n"
"<<How can I help you today?>>\n"
"\n"
"[ALL YOUR MINOR INJURIES ARE TREATED]"
msgstr ""
"<<抱歉啦，亲爱的，有病人来\n"
"了。我待会回拨给你……>>\n"
"护士一边说着，一边\n"
"打量起你来。\n"
"\n"
"<<今天有什么能帮到\n"
"你的吗？>>\n"
"\n"
"[治愈了所有轻伤]"

msgctxt "woh_addy:188"
msgid "SCHOOL NURSE"
msgstr "学校护士"

msgctxt "woh_addy:189"
msgid "Younger students are afraid of her... why?"
msgstr ""
"年轻一些的学生害怕她……\n"
"为什么？"

msgctxt "woh_addy:190"
msgid "The air here is noticeably colder... (+1% DOOM)"
msgstr "这里的空气明显冷了许多……（+1%灾厄）"

msgctxt "woh_addy:191"
msgid "<<The history of this region is just... fascinating. Why don't you discover it for yourself?>>"
msgstr ""
"<<这个地方的历史真是……美妙。为什么不自己去\n"
"发掘一下呢？>>"

