msgctxt "woh_small:24"
msgid "High quality lens, ready in a flash. A solid choice with an ample supply of film."
msgstr "优质镜头，瞬间就绪。胶卷充足的不二之选。"

msgctxt "woh_small:25"
msgid "You take a photo with flash, disorienting the enemy!"
msgstr "你开着闪光灯拍摄一张照片，迷惑敌人视野！"

msgctxt "woh_small:26"
