"（使用）：获得2点资金"

msgctxt "woh_small:38"
msgid "A fancy ring, turned up during an investigation. No weird markings, you could try to sell it."
msgstr "一枚好看的戒指，在一次调查中找到。上面没有奇怪的标记，可以尝试出售。"

msgctxt "woh_small:39"
msgid "You've managed to sell the NICE RING. (+2 FUNDS)"
