msgctxt "woh_ui:86"
msgid "(CUSTOMIZE THE PLAYTHROUGH)"
msgstr "（自定义游戏）"

msgctxt "woh_ui:87"
msgid "--- DEATH MODE: random ---"
msgstr "--- 死亡模式：随机 ---"

msgctxt "woh_ui:88"
msgid ""
"--- DEATH MODE: LAST STAND ---\n"
"Starting new encounters will kill you if you drop below 1 STAMINA/REASON but you can drop to -5 in combat. This option will allow you to rethink your strategy, forget spells or use a healing item."
msgstr ""
"--- 死亡模式：背水一战 ---\n"
"在体力/理智低于1时开始新的遭遇会导致死亡，但在战斗中体力/理智可以降至-5。此选项让您能够重新思考战略、遗忘法术或使用治疗物品。"

msgctxt "woh_ui:89"
msgid ""
"--- DEATH MODE: SUDDEN DEATH ---\n"
"Dropping below 1 STAMINA/REASON will kill you immediately.\n"
"Just like in real life."
msgstr ""
"--- 死亡模式：突然死亡 ---\n"
"体力/理智低于1时会立刻死亡。\n"
"如同现实生活中一样。"

msgctxt "woh_ui:90"
msgid ""
"SPINE-CHILLING STORY OF SCHOOL SCISSORS\n"
"\n"
"A tiny section of a standard playthrough, showcasing one of the available mysteries."
msgstr ""
"血溅邪剪\n"
"\n"
"从标准游戏中节选出的一小段，展示其中一个谜团。"

msgctxt "woh_ui:91"
msgid ""
"EXTRACURRICULAR ACTIVITY\n"
"\n"
"This option will prepare the standard [SKEPTIC] playthrough for you, allowing you to start the game without worrying about in-depth stuff for now."
msgstr ""
"课外活动\n"
"\n"
"此选项为您准备标准的[怀疑论者]游戏设置，让您能够直接\n"
"开始游戏，暂时无需担忧更深层次的东西。"

msgctxt "woh_ui:92"
msgid ""
"A true chaos.\n"
"This option will start a new playthrough, randomly selecting CHARACTER, OLD GOD, BACKGROUND and more."
msgstr ""
"真正的混沌。\n"
"此选项将开始新的游戏，随机选择角色、古神、背景等等。"

msgctxt "woh_ui:93"
msgid "Choose your own character, background and other playthrough specifics."
msgstr "自行选择角色、背景及其他具体游戏设置。"

